add('pb has static type B*. B::display is <b>not virtual</b>, so pb-&gt;display() selects B::display. Declaring C::display virtual does not retroactively make B::display virtual. B prints a and b with no separator, followed by a newline. Neither 2 nor 3 is printed.')
