q('31a','*++p means *(++p)','Prefix ++ advances p from arr[0] to arr[1]. Dereferencing that new pointer reads 0, so a becomes 0.')
q('31b','*p++ means *(p++)','Postfix ++ supplies the old pointer value for dereferencing. That reads arr[1], which is 0, so b becomes 0. The pointer itself advances to arr[2].')
q('31c','++*p means ++(*p)','Dereference p to access arr[2]. Prefix increment changes the element from 2 to 3 and produces the new value, so c becomes 3. p does not move.')
q('31d','(*p)++ changes the element','Postfix increment produces the element\'s old value, 3, so d becomes 3. The element then becomes 4. p still points to arr[2].')
